[
  {
    "text": "go and put his kettle on",
    "start_ind": 137,
    "end_ind": 161
  },
  {
    "text": "to climb on to an eagle’s back",
    "start_ind": 433,
    "end_ind": 463
  },
  {
    "text": "off rose fifteen great birds from the mountain’s side",
    "start_ind": 642,
    "end_ind": 695
  },
  {
    "text": "they began to go down",
    "start_ind": 1564,
    "end_ind": 1585
  },
  {
    "text": "to the top of this rock the eagles swooped",
    "start_ind": 2105,
    "end_ind": 2147
  },
  {
    "text": "set down their passengers",
    "start_ind": 2163,
    "end_ind": 2188
  },
  {
    "text": "May the wind under your wings bear you where the sun sails and the moon walks",
    "start_ind": 2335,
    "end_ind": 2412
  },
  {
    "text": "they parted",
    "start_ind": 2469,
    "end_ind": 2480
  },
  {
    "text": "Here the party gathered",
    "start_ind": 3165,
    "end_ind": 3188
  },
  {
    "text": "I ever meant to come with you",
    "start_ind": 3419,
    "end_ind": 3448
  },
  {
    "text": "Gandalf was going to come all the way",
    "start_ind": 3700,
    "end_ind": 3737
  },
  {
    "text": "the path which we should have been following",
    "start_ind": 4125,
    "end_ind": 4169
  },
  {
    "text": "if we had not left the mountain",
    "start_ind": 4171,
    "end_ind": 4202
  },
  {
    "text": "they have come here",
    "start_ind": 4264,
    "end_ind": 4283
  },
  {
    "text": "He does not come here",
    "start_ind": 4485,
    "end_ind": 4506
  },
  {
    "text": "We must go and find him",
    "start_ind": 4615,
    "end_ind": 4638
  },
  {
    "text": "I shall be off",
    "start_ind": 4685,
    "end_ind": 4699
  },
  {
    "text": "him not to leave them",
    "start_ind": 4774,
    "end_ind": 4795
  },
  {
    "text": "they crossed the ford",
    "start_ind": 5275,
    "end_ind": 5296
  },
  {
    "text": "began to march through the long green grass",
    "start_ind": 5329,
    "end_ind": 5372
  },
  {
    "text": "down the lines of the wide-armed oaks and the tall elms",
    "start_ind": 5377,
    "end_ind": 5432
  },
  {
    "text": "Bilbo as he went along",
    "start_ind": 5477,
    "end_ind": 5499
  },
  {
    "text": "other dragons came into this part of the world",
    "start_ind": 7378,
    "end_ind": 7424
  },
  {
    "text": "the goblins came into the hills out of the North",
    "start_ind": 7437,
    "end_ind": 7485
  },
  {
    "text": "I shall go back",
    "start_ind": 8213,
    "end_ind": 8228
  },
  {
    "text": "he once came from the mountains",
    "start_ind": 8253,
    "end_ind": 8284
  },
  {
    "text": "They still had a long way to walk before them",
    "start_ind": 8385,
    "end_ind": 8430
  },
  {
    "text": "Up slope and down dale they plodded",
    "start_ind": 8432,
    "end_ind": 8467
  },
  {
    "text": "We are getting near",
    "start_ind": 9359,
    "end_ind": 9378
  },
  {
    "text": "they came to a belt of tall and very ancient oaks",
    "start_ind": 9454,
    "end_ind": 9503
  },
  {
    "text": "begin to come after me",
    "start_ind": 9683,
    "end_ind": 9705
  },
  {
    "text": "the way I go",
    "start_ind": 9719,
    "end_ind": 9731
  },
  {
    "text": "he had better come",
    "start_ind": 9841,
    "end_ind": 9859
  },
  {
    "text": "Come on Mr. Baggins",
    "start_ind": 9876,
    "end_ind": 9895
  },
  {
    "text": "he went off along the hedge",
    "start_ind": 9954,
    "end_ind": 9981
  },
  {
    "text": "taking the frightened hobbit with him",
    "start_ind": 9982,
    "end_ind": 10019
  },
  {
    "text": "They soon came to a wooden gate",
    "start_ind": 10022,
    "end_ind": 10053
  },
  {
    "text": "the giant bees flying to and fro",
    "start_ind": 10365,
    "end_ind": 10397
  },
  {
    "text": "crawling in and out",
    "start_ind": 10402,
    "end_ind": 10421
  },
  {
    "text": "went down a wide track towards the house",
    "start_ind": 10509,
    "end_ind": 10549
  },
  {
    "text": "trotted up across the grass",
    "start_ind": 10593,
    "end_ind": 10620
  },
  {
    "text": "they galloped to the buildings",
    "start_ind": 10687,
    "end_ind": 10717
  },
  {
    "text": "They have gone",
    "start_ind": 10721,
    "end_ind": 10735
  },
  {
    "text": "they reached a courtyard",
    "start_ind": 10798,
    "end_ind": 10822
  },
  {
    "text": "You can be off!",
    "start_ind": 11326,
    "end_ind": 11341
  },
  {
    "text": "came forward",
    "start_ind": 11398,
    "end_ind": 11410
  },
  {
    "text": "did you go near them",
    "start_ind": 12696,
    "end_ind": 12716
  },
  {
    "text": "a pass which we had to cross",
    "start_ind": 12775,
    "end_ind": 12803
  },
  {
    "text": "we were coming out of the Lands over West into these countries",
    "start_ind": 12805,
    "end_ind": 12867
  },
  {
    "text": "come inside",
    "start_ind": 12910,
    "end_ind": 12921
  },
  {
    "text": "man leading the way through a dark door that opened out of the courtyard into the house",
    "start_ind": 12981,
    "end_ind": 13068
  },
  {
    "text": "Following him they found themselves in a wide hall",
    "start_ind": 13072,
    "end_ind": 13122
  },
  {
    "text": "They passed through this dim hall",
    "start_ind": 13314,
    "end_ind": 13347
  },
  {
    "text": "came through another smaller door into a sort of veranda",
    "start_ind": 13397,
    "end_ind": 13453
  },
  {
    "text": "I was coming over the mountains with a friend or two",
    "start_ind": 13910,
    "end_ind": 13962
  },
  {
    "text": "Thorin and Dori came round the house by the garden path",
    "start_ind": 14274,
    "end_ind": 14329
  },
  {
    "text": "They are on their way to visit the land of their fathers, away east beyond Mirkwood",
    "start_ind": 14895,
    "end_ind": 14978
  },
  {
    "text": "We were crossing by the High Pass",
    "start_ind": 15063,
    "end_ind": 15096
  },
  {
    "text": "should have brought us to the road that lies to the south of your country",
    "start_ind": 15102,
    "end_ind": 15175
  },
  {
    "text": "at the head of the pass we took refuge in a cave",
    "start_ind": 15386,
    "end_ind": 15434
  },
  {
    "text": "They don’t seem all to have come",
    "start_ind": 15633,
    "end_ind": 15665
  },
  {
    "text": "Nori and Ori were there",
    "start_ind": 15927,
    "end_ind": 15950
  },
  {
    "text": "to come in pairs",
    "start_ind": 16025,
    "end_ind": 16041
  },
  {
    "text": "You came pretty quick",
    "start_ind": 16085,
    "end_ind": 16106
  },
  {
    "text": "goblins came out",
    "start_ind": 16470,
    "end_ind": 16486
  },
  {
    "text": "Balin and Dwalin appeared",
    "start_ind": 16824,
    "end_ind": 16849
  },
  {
    "text": "Come in my merry men",
    "start_ind": 17237,
    "end_ind": 17257
  },
  {
    "text": "slipped inside the crack",
    "start_ind": 17681,
    "end_ind": 17705
  },
  {
    "text": "I followed down into the main hall",
    "start_ind": 17724,
    "end_ind": 17758
  },
  {
    "text": "jacks that haven’t yet come out of their boxes",
    "start_ind": 18056,
    "end_ind": 18102
  },
  {
    "text": "these two now appeared",
    "start_ind": 18202,
    "end_ind": 18224
  },
  {
    "text": "here they are",
    "start_ind": 18822,
    "end_ind": 18835
  },
  {
    "text": "let ’em all come",
    "start_ind": 18890,
    "end_ind": 18906
  },
  {
    "text": "Come along, you two",
    "start_ind": 18918,
    "end_ind": 18937
  },
  {
    "text": "their scramble down the stone-slide",
    "start_ind": 19475,
    "end_ind": 19510
  },
  {
    "text": "their climbing into trees",
    "start_ind": 19568,
    "end_ind": 19593
  },
  {
    "text": "he got up",
    "start_ind": 19626,
    "end_ind": 19635
  },
  {
    "text": "strode about",
    "start_ind": 19640,
    "end_ind": 19652
  },
  {
    "text": "the goblins came down from the hills",
    "start_ind": 19951,
    "end_ind": 19987
  },
  {
    "text": "here they are",
    "start_ind": 20327,
    "end_ind": 20340
  },
  {
    "text": "In came Bifur and Bofur",
    "start_ind": 20344,
    "end_ind": 20367
  },
  {
    "text": "followed immediately",
    "start_ind": 20501,
    "end_ind": 20521
  },
  {
    "text": "sending the dwarves off",
    "start_ind": 20884,
    "end_ind": 20907
  },
  {
    "text": "all been brought to the Carrock",
    "start_ind": 21287,
    "end_ind": 21318
  },
  {
    "text": "in trotted four beautiful white ponies and several large long-bodied grey dogs",
    "start_ind": 21821,
    "end_ind": 21899
  },
  {
    "text": "They went out again",
    "start_ind": 21987,
    "end_ind": 22006
  },
  {
    "text": "soon came back",
    "start_ind": 22011,
    "end_ind": 22025
  },
  {
    "text": "in came some snow-white sheep led by a large coal-black ram",
    "start_ind": 22389,
    "end_ind": 22448
  },
  {
    "text": "The other ponies came in",
    "start_ind": 23215,
    "end_ind": 23239
  },
  {
    "text": "they must soon venture into that forest",
    "start_ind": 24062,
    "end_ind": 24101
  },
  {
    "text": "the perils they had to pass",
    "start_ind": 24151,
    "end_ind": 24178
  },
  {
    "text": "they came to the dragon’s stronghold",
    "start_ind": 24186,
    "end_ind": 24222
  },
  {
    "text": "Beorn was gone",
    "start_ind": 25237,
    "end_ind": 25251
  },
  {
    "text": "The wind came down from mountains",
    "start_ind": 25611,
    "end_ind": 25644
  },
  {
    "text": "The wind went on from West to East",
    "start_ind": 25772,
    "end_ind": 25806
  },
  {
    "text": "on it went\n\no’er shaken pool under heavens cool",
    "start_ind": 25987,
    "end_ind": 26034
  },
  {
    "text": "It passed the lonely Mountain",
    "start_ind": 26078,
    "end_ind": 26107
  },
  {
    "text": "swept above the dragon’s lair",
    "start_ind": 26118,
    "end_ind": 26147
  },
  {
    "text": "It left the world",
    "start_ind": 26226,
    "end_ind": 26243
  },
  {
    "text": "took its flight\n\nover the wide seas",
    "start_ind": 26248,
    "end_ind": 26283
  },
  {
    "text": "The moon set sail upon the gale",
    "start_ind": 26299,
    "end_ind": 26330
  },
  {
    "text": "before he left us",
    "start_ind": 26594,
    "end_ind": 26611
  },
  {
    "text": "you must not stray outside",
    "start_ind": 26613,
    "end_ind": 26639
  }
]